  "worked_solution": "Multiplying each row in the first matrix by each column in the second, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}LM & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2} & 7 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4} & 3\\end{aligned}]\\text{\u00a0}[\\begin{aligned}-36 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot (-36)+7\\cdot 3 & \\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 4+7\\cdot 1 \\\\ \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot (-36)+3\\cdot 3 & \\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4+3\\cdot 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-18+21 & 2+7 \\\\ -9+9 & 1+3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 9 \\\\ 0 & 4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n.",
